      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name} Most likely. And worst part, two exactly same buttons \"show avatar details\" worked differently, when \"too much avatars\" was occurring, small menu button was greyed-out and unavailable, but big menu button was forcing avatar to load no matter what. Also, personally, it never crashed my headset to use it, so its shouldn't be excuse to remove this button by itself.",
