  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-08-13T13:46:32.338Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "So you know the ONLY WAY in the game to fix \"too many avatars\" problem ? By opening someone profile and click - show avatar details ? Well, vrchat just REMOVED IT, literally deleted all the buttons from profile. So now you can't fix it no matter what you do, without restarting either headset or rejoining for a small chance it will work. Only legit fast and convenient way was removed. Why ? I don't know, but im NOT thankful for that, this is a terrible update and it should be reverted. Actively removing only working features from the game is a treason against the game community. Respectfully. REVERT THE UPDATE, ADD BUTTONS BACK. Please.",
